Package: uzunyx-plymouth
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: plymouth, plymouth-label
Recommends: initramfs-tools
Description: Uzunyx boot splash
 Plymouth themes for the two Uzunyx editions, "uzunyx-akane" and
 "uzunyx-sora": the edition's icon and name on the distribution's dark
 background (#111318), with a shine that sweeps over the name and glints
 on its stars, and a password field in the style of Uzunyx windows for
 encrypted disks. Uzunyx Akane is made the default theme on first install,
 and "splash" is added to the kernel command line through
 /etc/default/grub.d so it is shown.
